Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:02:01.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm falling! I'm falling!\NI'm falling! I'm falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.03,0:02:15.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good! Safe and sound!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.36,0:02:19.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man that wore me out. I'm...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.07,0:02:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Safe and sound" my butt!\NI thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.94,0:02:23.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were the one that said
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.51,0:02:26.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we couldn't use the elevator\N'cause we'd get caught!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.64,0:02:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't have a choice!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.92,0:02:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean\N"Hey, let's jump down," idiot!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:30.31,0:02:31.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't glide around like
Dialogue: 5,0:02:31.20,0:02:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that square-nosed\Nshipwright, got it?!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:33.02,0:02:35.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:35.86,0:02:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever. It's fine\Nsince we're safe now.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:38.39,0:02:40.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then stop hitting me!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.03,0:02:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, we might not be safe for long.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't?\NWhy not? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.70,0:02:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island's\Ntopography and climate.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With this much wind blowing,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.04,0:02:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the atmospheric\Npressure falling so rapidly,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.68,0:02:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's likely going to be a typhoon here\Ntonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.75,0:03:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is called\N"The City of Water."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:02.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think about it:
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.42,0:03:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its greatest weakness\Nwould have to be flooding.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.89,0:03:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, so it floods. So what?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.06,0:03:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it worries me, that's all.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.46,0:03:10.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll check into it later.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.00,0:03:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's head back to the inn for\Nthe time being.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:16.51,0:03:17.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In compliance with
Dialogue: 5,0:03:17.31,0:03:18.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Aqua Laguna warning
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.41,0:03:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that was issued for the\Nentire island earlier today:
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.35,0:03:23.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}all docks on the\Nshipbuilding island are now
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.65,0:03:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to be considered public\Nshelter and evacuation centers.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.86,0:03:29.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Large crowds are expected,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.32,0:03:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so please take shelter\Nas quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.36,0:03:35.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Additionally, keep\Nin mind that Dock One
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.43,0:03:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is currently in\Na dangerous state.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right,\NI'll put the iron board on.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.41,0:03:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Honey, you sure we\Nhave everything we'll need?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.44,0:03:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes... Now, come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.67,0:03:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to take shelter in the shipyard.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.72,0:03:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patience, patience!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.26,0:03:51.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta be careful sealing this board.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.60,0:03:53.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the inside of our\Nhouse gets flooded,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.40,0:03:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,everything will be ruined.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.28,0:03:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! The wind\Nis starting to pick up!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.95,0:03:59.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The waves will be\Nhere anytime now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! If we take too long,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.96,0:04:04.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,those assassin pirates\Nare gonna show up, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.63,0:04:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.95,0:04:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd he disappear to?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.38,0:04:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he went this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.39,0:04:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be around here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.12,0:04:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NYou guys look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.62,0:04:22.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.78,0:04:25.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why're they chasing me?\NI don't understand!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.93,0:04:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec! Is this why\Neverybody's after me?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.27,0:04:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Culprits in the\Nassassination plot"?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.27,0:04:40.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well that sucks.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.40,0:04:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't go back to the inn now...\NI'll be out in the open.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.07,0:04:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Who goes\Nthere? Who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.94,0:04:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here! There's a suspicious\Nguy hiding in the alley!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.21,0:04:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?\NThere's no mistake?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.18,0:04:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm certain!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.43,0:04:53.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've been\Nstaying here at the inn
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since they\Nchecked in last night!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They took off just a little while ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.99,0:04:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're staying here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.97,0:05:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.08,0:05:02.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They still have lots of luggage left in\Ntheir room.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.63,0:05:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll be back for it sometime.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.18,0:05:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right! You guys\Nstay here, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.65,0:05:11.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest of you, search the\Nsurrounding area with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.28,0:05:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look sharp!\NLeave no stone unturned.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does everybody got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.56,0:05:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh. No one's here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you one hundred percent\Ncertain that this is their ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.45,0:05:34.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it!\NLook up there!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.15,0:05:37.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the flag of\Nthe Straw Hat pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.54,0:05:40.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They probably already abandoned her.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.81,0:05:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's all worn out.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.85,0:05:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. They're gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.89,0:05:51.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's\Nnot much left on board.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.49,0:05:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure she was\Nabandoned and left to sink.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.03,0:05:55.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's keep looking around.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.60,0:06:10.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Who were those guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.34,0:06:15.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there something going on in the city?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.46,0:06:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.29,0:06:19.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a trace of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.61,0:06:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Where are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They sure are persistent.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.29,0:06:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think everybody's okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.08,0:06:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These guys are\Nall over the place!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.21,0:06:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper and Sanji\Nare probably safe
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.91,0:06:40.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because no one knows\Ntheir faces yet, but still.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.28,0:06:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, we need to hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.50,0:06:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.39,0:06:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like the sea\Ntrain's still in operation.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.79,0:06:52.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess the noon departure has already\Nleft.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.29,0:06:53.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's another one\Nscheduled for tonight,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.03,0:06:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even in all this bad weather.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The 11 PM, leaving for Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sea train is\Npretty impressive.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.32,0:07:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NAny news on those pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.35,0:07:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.48,0:07:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can\Ncapture just one of those three
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the wanted posters,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.02,0:07:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll make 'em cough\Nup who the others are.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!\NBefore the waves get too high!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.28,0:07:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can't find Robin
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.35,0:07:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because she got\Non the sea train.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, if she did that\Nwould make things
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.85,0:07:20.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,worse than they already are.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.95,0:07:24.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven's too big an\Narea to cover on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.04,0:07:27.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if I did something to upset\Nher back at the bookstore?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.98,0:07:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.\NNo way that's the reason.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.54,0:07:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.04,0:07:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a\Nbeautiful woman
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.00,0:07:34.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who kind of looks like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean the one who's
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.20,0:07:37.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,about 20 years older\Nthan that picture?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.14,0:07:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I had, I would've\Ntold the newspapers
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or the Galley-La\NCompany about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.47,0:07:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To think\Nshe's an assassin.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.34,0:07:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kind of shocking, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.66,0:07:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I admire you for trying to\Ntrack down that criminal,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.26,0:07:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I suggest you find\Nyourself some shelter soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.70,0:07:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is on its way!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Things are getting dangerous around here.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.50,0:08:05.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about the others?\NThink they're okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.73,0:08:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Luffy's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.29,0:08:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami's the one that I'm\Nreally worried about right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.46,0:08:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, this city's\Nbecoming quite the ghost town.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.23,0:08:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wind's really picking up.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.03,0:08:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure most people are already in the\Nshelter.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.43,0:08:23.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where could she be?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.78,0:08:27.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.56,0:08:31.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That scent! Is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.87,0:08:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Chopper! What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.04,0:08:38.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.05,0:08:48.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.01,0:08:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oo... Waaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.09,0:08:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.36,0:09:00.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Did you hurt yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.80,0:09:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't just go\Nrunning off like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.83,0:09:06.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the hell is\Nthe matter with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.80,0:09:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One second, you're right beside me.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!\NIt's Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.42,0:09:17.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! Where in the\Nworld have you been?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.78,0:09:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's worried!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.68,0:09:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been looking\Nfor you everywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.92,0:09:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's head\Nback to the inn!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.99,0:09:24.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A lot's happened while you were gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.82,0:09:26.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything on the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.83,0:09:29.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This damn water's split us up.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.34,0:09:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on! I'll find\Nanother way over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't bother. It's all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.79,0:09:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay where you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.22,0:09:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I won't be coming back to you and\Nyour crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.94,0:09:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're parting ways\Nhere in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.87,0:09:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.80,0:09:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the world\Nare you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.37,0:09:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, you mean\Nthat stuff they said
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.88,0:09:56.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,about you in the newspaper?\NDon't worry about it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.29,0:09:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of us believes it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.38,0:10:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates are falsely accused of crimes all\Nthe time.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.24,0:10:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're easy targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:03.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,About that.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.74,0:10:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I apologize for pinning such
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:07.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,an unreasonable\Ncrime on all of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.38,0:10:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But as far as my involvement...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.38,0:10:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything that was said in the newspaper\Nis true.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.13,0:10:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Late last night, I broke\Ninto the mayor's place
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.33,0:10:17.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of residence and shot him.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.23,0:10:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.87,0:10:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inside me, I carry a darkness that none of\Nyou know about.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.30,0:10:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One day, that darkness will be the end of\Nall of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.91,0:10:31.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Every organization\Nthat she's had something
Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.24,0:10:34.24,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,to do with in the past\Nhas been annihilated.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.28,0:10:38.49,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Not one single, solitary\Nmember escaped, except for her.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.52,0:10:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you'll\Nbe taking the fall
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.97,0:10:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for last night's attack\Nwhile I escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.72,0:10:44.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And let me warn you.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The situation will only get worse.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.82,0:10:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!\NI don't understand!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.49,0:10:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why I'm doing it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.99,0:10:53.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.46,0:10:56.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.10,0:10:59.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.97,0:11:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please! We'll work\Nthis out together!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.04,0:11:06.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although I only spent\Na short time with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from this day forward.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.90,0:11:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We will never see each other again.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.23,0:11:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all of the kindness you've\Nshown me.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.60,0:11:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Know that I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.88,0:11:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.25,0:11:39.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No... please...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This can't...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.79,0:11:45.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.15,0:11:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.55,0:11:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.46,0:11:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! You don't know\Nwhat you're saying! Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.06,0:12:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Please! Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.37,0:12:11.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.91,0:12:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I lost track of her scent.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.65,0:12:24.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.82,0:12:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.38,0:12:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go meet up with\NLuffy and the others
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.73,0:12:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and tell them everything that\Nhappened between us and Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.37,0:12:34.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to leave out a single\Nword.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.37,0:12:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.31,0:12:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for me, let's just\Nsay I have a plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.44,0:12:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll try to be careful.\NWe'll meet up later.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.95,0:12:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.27,0:12:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check the alleys!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.50,0:12:50.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't think\Nthey're on the rooftops, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! We lost 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.34,0:12:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.\NI'm sure they went this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.88,0:12:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better keep moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right,\Nbut we should check
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,inside the buildings, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.69,0:13:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good.\NWe'll split up. Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.09,0:13:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.72,0:13:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it okay now?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.96,0:13:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd you last see them?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uhhh...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.63,0:13:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.80,0:13:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've gotta evacuate!\NStop pestering me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.27,0:13:50.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on.\NI have money, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.30,0:13:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here take it.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.75,0:13:54.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need as much lumber, tar, and rope as\Nthis'll buy.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.95,0:13:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, and also some nails,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.89,0:13:58.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,latches and tin plates,\Nif you don't mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.59,0:14:00.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said I'm closing the shop.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.59,0:14:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll just\Ntake a second, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.79,0:14:09.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.98,0:14:12.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid this money\Nain't gonna buy much for ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.68,0:14:15.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Then... how\N'bout I sell my tools?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will that make up for the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Come on! Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.65,0:14:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't do barter.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.85,0:14:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's the big city, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.78,0:14:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it's cash only.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.33,0:14:30.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You win. But\Nlet's make it quick.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.34,0:14:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure\Nyou're okay carrying that
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with all those injuries?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.41,0:14:45.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't you get some friends\Nto help you out? Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.58,0:14:49.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew this was a bad idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.54,0:15:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! This isn't gonna work!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.11,0:15:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I got it.\NThis is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:13.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.75,0:15:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I can do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.52,0:15:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, look.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.04,0:15:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, take these.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.65,0:15:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're hungry, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.57,0:15:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.18,0:15:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.\NTry to be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.01,0:15:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.68,0:15:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These are good.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.31,0:15:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really good.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.35,0:15:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess that guy was pretty nice after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.91,0:16:11.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The waves sure are getting high,\Naren't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.50,0:16:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Merry.\NYou're gonna be just fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.08,0:16:34.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, you flew in the sky,\Nremember?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.28,0:16:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got nothing\Nto be afraid of!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.44,0:16:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh ho ho! Whoa, what's\Ngot you riled up, big guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.34,0:17:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon Franky,\Nyou can tell us!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.52,0:17:09.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.23,0:17:10.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,AARRGH!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got so much rage inside me,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.86,0:17:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel another rampage\Ncomin' on right about now!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.93,0:17:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me, bro,\Ndon't rampage alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.39,0:17:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As always, thanks for the drinks,\NBlueno!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.41,0:17:25.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.06,0:17:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What got into him all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.20,0:17:30.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there something going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.16,0:17:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never can tell with that guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.03,0:17:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only idiots know what idiots are thinking.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.64,0:17:54.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like the crowd cleared out.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.39,0:17:56.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no thanks to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.13,0:17:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that Luffy\Nand I had a perfectly good
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.46,0:18:01.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hiding place until you lead\Nthat angry mob straight to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.76,0:18:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, with that\Nmany people looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they were gonna\Nfind you anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.28,0:18:09.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did you know we\Nwere down there, Chopper?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.69,0:18:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your smell.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.58,0:18:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah... I shoulda known.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.49,0:18:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But wait, wasn't Sanji with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.25,0:18:17.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, he was.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.57,0:18:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! That doesn't\Nmake any sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did Robin really\Nsay that to you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.82,0:18:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were prepared\Nfor this, weren't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.19,0:18:52.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, Robin was our enemy before we\Nlet her join the crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.59,0:18:55.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This might be our only\Nchance to find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:57.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we shouldn't run away.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.43,0:19:03.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's still lot of things\Nwe don't know about Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.37,0:19:07.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to decide if she's a friend\Nor a foe.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.24,0:19:10.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,2000,0.5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&)}The
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.99,0:19:12.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,2000,0.5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&)}situation will get worse.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.51,0:19:17.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,2000,0.5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&)}From this day forward we will\Nnever see each other again.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.19,0:19:23.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.19,0:19:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all she said, Chopper?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.86,0:19:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.83,0:19:30.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If she says she won't\Nsee us after today
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and things are gonna get worse,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.57,0:19:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,maybe that means\Nthe attack on Iceburg
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.21,0:19:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was just a warm-up\Nand she has something
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.98,0:19:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even bigger\Nplanned for tonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.65,0:19:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know why\NRobin's doing any of this,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.75,0:19:46.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so it's hard to make a guess\Nas to what she's planning.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.75,0:19:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But seeing how much\Ncommotion her first attack
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on the mayor caused,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.92,0:19:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's only one way\Nto make things worse.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.43,0:19:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words,\Nshe'll murder him.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.77,0:20:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think that's what she's\Ntrying to tell us, at least.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.41,0:20:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also since she told Chopper
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that she'll be pinning\Nthe crime on us,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.91,0:20:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it could be that she's feeding\Nus all these little hints
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.07,0:20:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to try and lure us out\Nto the crime scene tonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.34,0:20:12.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.29,0:20:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that is her plan,\Nit would be convenient
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.36,0:20:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for her if we did\Nhappen to show up.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.29,0:20:18.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since that would put us\Nat the scene of the crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.75,0:20:20.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You say you don't\Nknow what she's thinking,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.19,0:20:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it sound to me like you've
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.06,0:20:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,already decided that she's our enemy!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.79,0:20:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about possibilities here,\Nthat's all.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.05,0:20:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should always be prepared
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.98,0:20:29.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for the worst-case\Nscenario, understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.85,0:20:31.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I get locked into a\Nsingle line of thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:34.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it'll only slow me down.\NIf she's my friend,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.96,0:20:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to be ready to forgive
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.72,0:20:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but if she's my enemy\NI have to be ready to fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.93,0:20:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our best chance to settle\Nthis is tonight. Are we going?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.20,0:20:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not that\NI object to the plan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.77,0:20:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we're still\Nforgetting something.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.27,0:20:58.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji said he saw Robin walking
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.04,0:21:00.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with someone in\Na mask, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.67,0:21:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Obviously that wasn't one of us,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.31,0:21:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but Iceburg said\Nexactly the same thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That he was attacked by Robin
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.81,0:21:08.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and a large man in a mask\Nthat he didn't recognize.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.98,0:21:11.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoever he is,\NI bet he's the reason
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.24,0:21:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin is doing\Nall of this stuff.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.25,0:21:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! That means\Nit isn't her fault
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.86,0:21:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we just need to beat\Nthe real bad guy. Right?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.43,0:21:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the ideal situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.90,0:21:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's also possible that this\Nguy is one of Robin's friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.74,0:21:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The problem is we\Ndon't have much to go
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.41,0:21:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on other than\N"a big man in a mask."
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.84,0:21:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So where do we even start?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.52,0:21:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, what is our goal here?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.71,0:21:34.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We find Robin and capture her.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.21,0:21:38.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the only way\Nwe'll ever know the truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.68,0:21:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.68,0:21:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're wasting time here trying to figure\Nit out.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.91,0:21:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just one thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.25,0:21:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin won't be easy to catch.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.82,0:21:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, the World\NGovernment's been trying
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.47,0:21:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for 20 years and it\Nstill hasn't happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.18,0:21:54.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like he said, it's the only way we'll\Nreally know for sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.51,0:21:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's settle\Nthis right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.36,0:21:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.02,0:22:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on. Galley-La's waiting.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.06,0:22:12.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn. It's late.\NWhere'd Straw Hat run off to?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.30,0:22:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.41,0:22:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All these streets are gonna flood before\Nlong!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.27,0:22:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's head back.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.69,0:22:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the main office.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.16,0:22:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good, boss.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.85,0:22:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard him, guys,\Ntime to move out!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.26,0:22:30.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out here and\Nfight me, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.96,0:22:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?! Stop hiding!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.07,0:22:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought that little\Nturd had some backbone,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.27,0:22:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Won't even show his face.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.17,0:22:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know what you're saying, bro,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.84,0:22:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but to be fair, the whole\Nisland is hunting him down
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.11,0:22:48.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,right now, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.27,0:22:50.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Exactly! I bet he's hiding,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.11,0:22:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if he hasn't been\Ncaught already.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.91,0:22:54.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's\Nwith this weird crab
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.58,0:22:55.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,walk thing all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.55,0:22:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we face the front,\Nthen the wind catches
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.48,0:23:01.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our hair and we blow away!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.59,0:23:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, the\Nweather isn't the only thing
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.56,0:23:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that's out of control today.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.22,0:23:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.42,0:23:08.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like you've got a rampage going on\Ninside you, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.03,0:23:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up. I'm just like\Nthat this week, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.20,0:23:14.75,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.90,0:23:16.76,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\an8}– Hey, it's bro! Hey, bro!\N– Hey, it's bro! Hey, bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.80,0:23:19.37,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, if it isn't Zambai!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.41,0:23:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me, tell me that you\Nbeat up those stupid Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.52,0:23:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, but I tried to.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.96,0:23:25.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some angry mob showed up,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.12,0:23:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,got in the way,\Nthen Luffy took off.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.06,0:23:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.43,0:23:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are those guys lucky or what?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.43,0:23:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you're on a rampage, nobody survives!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's weird. I wondered\Nwhy that weak dude
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.48,0:23:37.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with the long nose was\Nfixing the ship on his own.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.95,0:23:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I figured that you'd wrecked\Nup the rest of the crew
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.94,0:23:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so bad that he was the only one\Nleft who could do anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.94,0:23:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. You found one of 'em?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.49,0:23:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, on their ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.06,0:23:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just fine,\N'cause all we need is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.22,0:23:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.43,0:23:59.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll use that loser as bait\Nto lure out the rest of 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.86,0:24:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Bro's got his\Nbad guy face on, guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.10,0:24:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, you\Ngood-for-nothings,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.84,0:24:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to march\Nthrough the town
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.07,0:24:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and spread the word for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.21,0:24:11.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say "we've got Long-Nose
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.25,0:24:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and if you don't want him\Nswimming with the fishes,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.24,0:24:16.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then come to the\Nwarehouse under the bridge."
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.04,0:24:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell 'em Franky sent ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.12,0:24:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,\NI'll go nab Long Nose
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we can make good\Non our little threat.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.96,0:24:30.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got it, Bro! I swear\Nwe won't let you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.03,0:24:45.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's my special bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.43,0:24:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Aqua Laguna! Aqua Laguna!\N– Aqua Laguna! Aqua Laguna!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.10,0:24:53.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is coming for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.14,0:24:54.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here comes a big wave!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.81,0:24:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So do you know\Nwhat's going on
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.21,0:24:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with those Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.44,0:25:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.31,0:25:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think they've caught them yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.08,0:25:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tsk! Still on the loose!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.08,0:25:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah... That's no good!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.78,0:25:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And with everyone so\Nworked up about the storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.42,0:25:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll have the perfect\Nchance to attack again.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.41,0:25:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what I heard,\Nis that tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.03,0:25:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all the craftsmen from\Nthe Galley-La Company
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.10,0:25:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will be guarding the main\Noffice to protect the mayor.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.70,0:25:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's a really\Nbig deal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.37,0:25:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many people\Nhave the Straw Hats got, anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.94,0:25:29.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some say 50.\NSome say 100 or even more!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.38,0:25:32.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember, the captain's got a\N100 million bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.85,0:25:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For all we know, he could be\Nsending an army of 3,000 men
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.15,0:25:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to fight the\Nshipwrights as we speak!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.22,0:25:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?!\NThat sounds really bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.97,0:25:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, men,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.94,0:25:50.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hold your formation\Nand don't give an inch!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.87,0:25:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.38,0:25:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even let a single\Nfly get through, got it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.14,0:25:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.43,0:26:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! Wahahaha!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.30,0:26:18.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.83,0:26:21.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you please\Nbe quiet, Tiletone?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.06,0:26:22.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.86,0:26:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,weren't spotted on\Nthe sea train.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.40,0:26:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means they're still here on the\Nisland somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.98,0:26:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still. They'd be complete\Nidiots if they tried
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.00,0:26:33.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to show up with all\Nof these guards around.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.17,0:26:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'd think,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.22,0:26:35.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that didn't\Nstop the dumbass
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.45,0:26:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that barged in\Nhere earlier, did it?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.27,0:26:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.07,0:26:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mwell, this is\Nreassuring, but it's a bit much.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.64,0:26:49.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They wanted to do this for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.31,0:26:50.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not royalty.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.92,0:26:52.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me sir,\Nbut why on earth
Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.75,0:26:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,did you put Nico Robin's\Nwanted poster up on your wall?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.72,0:26:58.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It bother you?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.39,0:27:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.79,0:27:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.44,0:27:07.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's better if you don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.95,0:27:13.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That girl is a demon.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.15,0:27:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There sure are\Na lot of people out there.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.75,0:27:44.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a little far, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.94,0:27:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine if you rocket through the\Nwindow, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.29,0:27:49.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After Robin shows up, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.25,0:27:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That' right. If we\Nmake a commotion first,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.28,0:27:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then they'll just sneak in while\Nwe're dealing with the guards.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.85,0:27:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's be patient.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.76,0:27:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.69,0:27:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strike at anything\Nthat moves, men! Got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.69,0:28:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
